Preserve wxWidgets 3.2.12 GTK top-level registration order before CreateBase,
which uses the list to avoid assigning child minimum sizes to top-level windows.
Use GTK4 GtkEditable alignment for GtkSpinButton, which is no longer GtkEntry.

--- src/gtk/toplevel_gtk4.inc.orig
